    "body": "Bumps the github-actions group with 3 updates in the / directory: [actions/create-github-app-token](https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token), [github/codeql-action](https://github.com/github/codeql-action) and [zizmorcore/zizmor-action](https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action).\n\nUpdates `actions/create-github-app-token` from 3.2.0 to 3.3.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/releases\">actions/create-github-app-token's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v3.3.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/compare/v3.2.0...v3.3.0\">3.3.0</a> (2026-10-12)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update permission inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/399\">#399</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a47236f79f79fcbc3532af49fe3a5ded89529b6e\">a47236f</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump nested undici from 6.24.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/403\">#403</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/12461a3a794e67c032f1eff5bb95ece9427eb4fb\">12461a3</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/395\">#395</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a69c19ddfdf8e1ab093900e0064524ce9309c807\">a69c19d</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">actions/create-github-app-token's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/compare/v3.2.0...v3.3.0\">3.3.0</a> (2026-10-12)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update permission inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/399\">#399</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a47236f79f79fcbc3532af49fe3a5ded89529b6e\">a47236f</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump nested undici from 6.24.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/403\">#403</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/12461a3a794e67c032f1eff5bb95ece9427eb4fb\">12461a3</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/395\">#395</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a69c19ddfdf8e1ab093900e0064524ce9309c807\">a69c19d</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/64ab729a6294000f5aa4a4bc0b73d1f32bc45510\"><code>64ab729</code></a> chore(main): release 3.3.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/402\">#402</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/f3a828e4b91180d3a46ac1f4b43fa8384b0dea07\"><code>f3a828e</code></a> ci: create signed dist commits in release workflow (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/404\">#404</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/655017ffa7c6b0c6e4210729fa6bce35cacd8ca0\"><code>655017f</code></a> docs: clarify when owner grants access to all repositories (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/378\">#378</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/12461a3a794e67c032f1eff5bb95ece9427eb4fb\"><code>12461a3</code></a> fix(deps): bump nested undici from 6.24.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/403\">#403</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a47236f79f79fcbc3532af49fe3a5ded89529b6e\"><code>a47236f</code></a> feat: update permission inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/399\">#399</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a69c19ddfdf8e1ab093900e0064524ce9309c807\"><code>a69c19d</code></a> fix(deps): bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 u...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/d5cb7ae41d64331820d88810a4878e0942ec992a\"><code>d5cb7ae</code></a> build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/384\">#384</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/575da866bd0a42d7f234a8645831d55573252b09\"><code>575da86</code></a> build(deps): bump stefanzweifel/git-auto-commit-action from 7.1.0 to 7.2.0 in...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/e85f677b44da0d1f08115ce52cdfd8fd2c69874a\"><code>e85f677</code></a> test: omit stack traces from snapshots (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/401\">#401</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/9419396df4d5672241cfb593dadc19758e54a204\"><code>9419396</code></a> build(deps-dev): bump c8 from 11.0.0 to 12.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/400\">#400</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/compare/v3.2.0...v3.3.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `github/codeql-action` from 4.38.3 to 4.39.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/releases\">github/codeql-action's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.39.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Breaking change</em>: Bump the minimum required CodeQL bundle version to 2.20.7. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4205\">#4205</a></li>\n<li>The <code>codeql-action/analyze</code> step now validates that a correct argument for the <code>checkout_path</code> input has been provided. The <code>checkout_path</code> input must be set to the path where the repository that is being analyzed is checked out at on the runner, if that path is something other than the workspace root. If the path does not point to a repository checkout or is different from the path that was used by <code>codeql-action/init</code>, then the CodeQL Action now produces a warning. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4148\">#4148</a></li>\n<li>Resolved an issue with third-party caching implementations that prevented caches from being restored correctly. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4206\">#4206</a></li>\n<li>The <code>codeql-action/start-proxy</code> step that is used in Code Scanning Default Setup now finds CodeQL releases using the same logic as <code>codeql-action/init</code>. This primarily benefits customers who are using GitHub instances other than <code>github.com</code> where the <code>codeql-action/start-proxy</code> step may previously have been unable to locate recent releases and ended up using outdated versions of the private registry authentication proxy as a result. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4198\">#4198</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">github/codeql-action's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>4.39.0 - 15 Oct 2026</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Breaking change</em>: Bump the minimum required CodeQL bundle version to 2.20.7. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4205\">#4205</a></li>\n<li>The <code>codeql-action/analyze</code> step now validates that a correct argument for the <code>checkout_path</code> input has been provided. The <code>checkout_path</code> input must be set to the path where the repository that is being analyzed is checked out at on the runner, if that path is something other than the workspace root. If the path does not point to a repository checkout or is different from the path that was used by <code>codeql-action/init</code>, then the CodeQL Action now produces a warning. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4148\">#4148</a></li>\n<li>Resolved an issue with third-party caching implementations that prevented caches from being restored correctly. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4206\">#4206</a></li>\n<li>The <code>codeql-action/start-proxy</code> step that is used in Code Scanning Default Setup now finds CodeQL releases using the same logic as <code>codeql-action/init</code>. This primarily benefits customers who are using GitHub instances other than <code>github.com</code> where the <code>codeql-action/start-proxy</code> step may previously have been unable to locate recent releases and ended up using outdated versions of the private registry authentication proxy as a result. <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/pull/4198\">#4198</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/6f2ac81f5cd81fe351a197ba0b00d91d03cd2aee\"><code>6f2ac81</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/issues/4239\">#4239</a> from github/update-v4.39.0-d63383a73</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/eb1c428e6e3725d2b527aec0ee5db4303c8f669d\"><code>eb1c428</code></a> Trigger workflows</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/444333376e064d207fe1dc74e881528bf11649c1\"><code>4443333</code></a> Update changelog for v4.39.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/d63383a7318b5332e86725adf62ac19528a9786a\"><code>d63383a</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/issues/4233\">#4233</a> from github/mbg/start-proxy/report-version</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/8dec0b9f88b61a76f5fc97056ee8e7dc8a1a8022\"><code>8dec0b9</code></a> Rename <code>path</code> to <code>result</code> in tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/4eabea6b5e5123ae16fffacf06e86d9d3864c350\"><code>4eabea6</code></a> Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into mbg/start-proxy/report-version</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/57938b85687300731b9b53559017c143d849481d\"><code>57938b8</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/issues/4201\">#4201</a> from github/mario-campos/automate-changenotes-assemble</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/ee07b503f465bcf3338b6e4807a36789e3106f4b\"><code>ee07b50</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/issues/4236\">#4236</a> from github/mbg/add-missing-changenotes</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/a897ed5c2eeeb4862bf224c65f62a8b2478eb581\"><code>a897ed5</code></a> Add change note for <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/issues/4206\">#4206</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/commit/c8bd0195fb2ec9584b1bd6faf9ff5e2983c63d82\"><code>c8bd019</code></a> Add change note for <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/github/codeql-action/issues/4198\">#4198</a></li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/github/codeql-action/compare/v4.38.3...v4.39.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `zizmorcore/zizmor-action` from 0.6.4 to 0.7.1\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/releases\">zizmorcore/zizmor-action's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v0.7.1</h2>\n<h1>zizmor changes</h1>\n<h2>Bug Fixes 🐛🔗</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed a regression in 1.31.0 where some ignore comments/configurations would no longer apply to the dangerous-triggers audit</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>action changes</h1>\n<p>The default version of zizmor is now 1.31.1.</p>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sync zizmor versions by <a href=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/pull/178\">zizmorcore/zizmor-action#178</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/compare/v0.7.0...v0.7.1\">https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/compare/v0.7.0...v0.7.1</a></p>\n<h2>v0.7.0</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/woodruffw/\">Sponsorship is appreciated!</a></p>\n<h1>zizmor notes</h1>\n<h2>Enhancements 🌱<a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/release-notes/#enhancements\">🔗</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#typosquat-uses\">typosquat-uses</a> audit now supports pre-commit config inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2437\">#2437</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#self-hosted-runner\">self-hosted-runner</a> audit is now significantly more precise (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2350\">#2350</a>)</p>\n<p>Many thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/ubiratansoares\"><code>@​ubiratansoares</code></a> for proposing and implementing this enhancement!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#dangerous-triggers\">dangerous-triggers</a> audit now considers the issue_comment trigger fundamentally dangerous (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2396\">#2396</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>zizmor is now aware of the image_version workflow trigger (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2397\">#2397</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#dangerous-triggers\">dangerous-triggers</a> audit now produces more precise finding/diagnostic spans (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2402\">#2402</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#cache-poisoning\">cache-poisoning</a> audit is now aware of <a href=\"https://github.com/pnpm/setup\">pnpm/setup</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2409\">#2409</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#unpinned-images\">unpinned-images</a> audit now produces more precise findings when the user's workflow contains an indirect matrix (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2395\">#2395</a>)</p>\n<p>Many thanks to <a href=\"https://github.com/ubiratansoares\"><code>@​ubiratansoares</code></a> for proposing and implementing this enhancement!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#cache-poisoning\">cache-poisoning</a> audit is now aware of GitHub's new cache-mode: setting, and will skip any findings that would occur when a job has an effective cache-mode: none (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2418\">#2418</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/audits/#cache-poisoning\">cache-poisoning</a> audit now flags usages of cache-mode: write and cache-mode: write-only with dangerous triggers, i.e. triggers that give an attacker privileged code execution (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2426\">#2426</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>zizmor now uses a tree-sitter grammar for PowerShell that's more precise/capable of capturing more non-trivial PowerShell expressions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor/issues/2444\">#2444</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Bug Fixes 🐛<a href=\"https://docs.zizmor.sh/release-notes/#bug-fixes\">🔗</a></h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/85b2b9fb8e3325e7a23d7d0a9d7ba5ae0f999e3e\"><code>85b2b9f</code></a> Sync zizmor versions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/178\">#178</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/38c745a43764dcc8bcfd364e8295870e252e957c\"><code>38c745a</code></a> README: bump pins (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/177\">#177</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/f9597c869b2e67095f9b527070297a13a6efe928\"><code>f9597c8</code></a> Sync zizmor versions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/175\">#175</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/2181e51ed8d58b9304e4a561374bb36d5599af3a\"><code>2181e51</code></a> Bump sync-zizmor-versions.py to Python 3.11 for locking (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/174\">#174</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/27d989be9329e6cff7f80baf450ca83bf4c94898\"><code>27d989b</code></a> chore(deps): bump the github-actions group with 2 updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/173\">#173</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/a91218c45134530ecc7aefc3eec3f997a279ad37\"><code>a91218c</code></a> Bootstrap zizmor without Docker (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/169\">#169</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/ee3f1bf153a9caa7d162d7324ef8314ec3f91862\"><code>ee3f1bf</code></a> chore(deps): bump the github-actions group with 2 updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/170\">#170</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/commit/8eacaa5f3f72b6638f4f87c3f66113bbc0f363dd\"><code>8eacaa5</code></a> README: bump pins (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/issues/167\">#167</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/zizmorcore/zizmor-action/compare/cc914d7f3750a2d13d75c7f184a1060aa0e9d482...85b2b9fb8e3325e7a23d7d0a9d7ba5ae0f999e3e\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
